{{!-- A vislae's soul and their secret name.

      At the foot of the Magic tab rather than in the biography: both are
      magical facts about the character — the soul is what they are underneath,
      the secret name is what magic knows them by — and the tab holding their
      order, their practices and their secrets is where a player is already
      looking when either matters.

      Guarded on showSecrets, which is owners and GMs. An observer reading the
      sheet learns neither, which is the whole point of them. --}}
{{#if showSecrets}}
  {{!-- An .isun-panel, like the secrets strip above it: on this tab a section
        is a framed, padded panel with its heading in an entry-list-header, and
        a bordered aside was the biography's idiom rather than this one. The
        indigo stays — it is what says at a glance that this part is not the
        table's to read. --}}
  <div class="isun-panel secret-soul mt-4">
    <div class="entry-list-header">
      <h3><i class="fa-solid fa-eye-slash"></i> {{localize "ISUN.SecretSoul"}}</h3>
    </div>
    <p class="hint">{{localize "ISUN.SecretSoulHint"}}</p>
    <div class="grid-2col">
      {{!-- The Soul is an item, not a name. Drop one anywhere on the sheet to
            set it; the slot opens it, matching the character sentence. --}}
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>{{localize "ISUN.Soul"}}</label>
        {{#if soul}}
          <a class="soul-slot filled" data-action="open-item" data-item-id="{{soul.id}}"
             data-tooltip="{{localize 'ISUN.OpenSoul'}}">
            <img src="{{soul.img}}" alt="{{soul.name}}" />
            <span class="soul-name">{{soul.name}}</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-from-square"></i>
          </a>
        {{else}}
          <div class="soul-slot empty">
            {{#if system.meta.soulName}}
              {{!-- A name typed before Souls were items; the item itself still
                    needs dropping on. --}}
              <span class="soul-legacy">{{system.meta.soulName}}</span>
              <span class="soul-hint">{{localize "ISUN.SoulDropReplace"}}</span>
            {{else}}
              <span class="soul-hint">{{localize "ISUN.SoulDrop"}}</span>
            {{/if}}
          </div>
        {{/if}}
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label>{{localize "ISUN.SecretName"}}</label>
        <input type="text" name="system.meta.secretName" value="{{system.meta.secretName}}" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
{{/if}}
